{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19606","headline":"赋得竹箭有筠 · 席夔","name":"赋得竹箭有筠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共爱东南美，青青叹有筠。\n贞姿衆木异，秀色四时均。\n枝叶当无改，风霜岂惮频。\n虚心如待物，劲节自留春。\n鲜润期栖凤，婵娟可并人。\n可怜初箨卷，粉泽更宜新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}